449
00:24:30.200 --> 00:24:32.200
Atoms come in, electrons go out.

450
00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:36.200
In this new industrial revolution, electrons come in, and floating point numbers come out.

451
00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:40.200
And just like the last industrial revolution, nobody understood why this electricity is so valuable

452
00:24:40.200 --> 00:24:44.200
and is now sold, marketed, kilowatt hours per dollar.

453
00:24:44.200 --> 00:24:47.200
And so now we have a million tokens per dollar.

