00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:53.200
And so that same logic is as incomprehensible to a lot of people as the last industrial revolution,

455
00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:56.200
but it's going to be completely normal in the next ten years.

456
00:24:56.200 --> 00:25:04.200
Well, these tokens are going to create new products, new services, enhance productivity on a whole slew of industries.

