00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:40.200
And when you have a team that's with you that feels the way there together, in a lot of ways, we've codified, we've encoded the magic of the company in a way that no words can describe.

645
00:34:40.200 --> 00:34:41.200
And you don't want to lose that.

646
00:34:41.200 --> 00:34:42.200
You don't want to lose that.

